{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-02-02 10:00:00', 'title': "SOUTHERN COMPANY ONCE AGAIN NAMED ONE OF 'WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES' BY FORTUNE MAGAZINE", 'text': 'ATLANTA, FEB. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOUTHERN COMPANY HAS BEEN NAMED TO FORTUNE MAGAZINE\'S 2022 WORLD\'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES LIST, A RANKING OF THE WORLD\'S MOST RESPECTED AND REPUTABLE COMPANIES, BASED ON A\u202fSURVEY OF ALMOST 3,800 EXECUTIVES, DIRECTORS AND ANALYSTS. "IT IS AN HONOR TO ONCE AGAIN RECEIVE THIS DISTINCTION FROM FORTUNE\xa0AND BE INCLUDED AMONG THE BEST COMPANIES IN THE WORLD," SAID SOUTHERN COMPANY CHAIRMAN, PRESIDENT & CEO TOM FANNING.'}